      },
      "lineNbr": 6660,
      "author": {
        "id": 1001758
      },
      "writtenOn": "2026-08-11T16:35:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "@Michael.Kao@quantatw.com Thats my question -\n1. Why did we even do this for legacy way. Looks like u r creating a fake board and connecting these detectors to that, isn\u0027t it ?\n2. If #1 is correct, then what is the reason for creating that fake board and not add these configs to the existing hardware inventory board exposes record ? (FYI: The associations will end up getting created to fake boards in dbus-sensors.)\n3. How did we do this on Ventura?",
      "parentUuid": "b3139b88_0a266ac0",
      "revId": "07589a1f72a4f105d2e500e8a1f415a050adc971",
      "serverId": "adbd0a64-1f21-4d83-b585-671fe73cb6e4"
